1
00:00:00,802 --> 00:00:02,892
(Sheldon:)When did we become friends?

2
00:00:05,390 --> 00:00:07,100
(Sheldon:)I.e., I couldn't become Green Lantern...

3
00:00:07,267 --> 00:00:09,267
(Sheldon:)...unless I was chosen
by the Guardians of Oa.

4
00:00:09,436 --> 00:00:12,436
(Sheldon:)Given enough startup capital
and an adequate research facility...

5
00:00:12,606 --> 00:00:14,606
(Sheldon:)...I could be Batman.

6
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:20,320
- You could be Batman?
- Sure.

7
00:00:20,489 --> 00:00:21,569
[IN DEEP VOICE]
I'm Batman.

8
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:22,780
[IN NORMAL VOICE]
See?

9
00:00:25,202 --> 00:00:26,242
- Hi, guys.
- Hey.

10
00:00:26,411 --> 00:00:27,991
(Sheldon:)- Hi, Penny.
- Hey.

11
00:00:29,081 --> 00:00:32,751
(Leonard:)If you're not doing anything Friday night,
I thought we could go see a movie.

12
00:00:32,918 --> 00:00:35,588
(Penny:)You know, I think I have the dinner shift
on Friday.

13
00:00:35,754 --> 00:00:38,464
- Okay. What about Saturday?
- You know, I'm not sure.

14
00:00:38,632 --> 00:00:41,632
(Penny:)The manager hasn't posted the schedule.
How about I let you know?

15
00:00:41,802 --> 00:00:42,802
- Great.
- Okay.

16
00:00:42,970 --> 00:00:48,600
(Leonard:)So you just let me know when you know.
Okay, so... Oh, God, I am the bad fish.

17
00:00:50,352 --> 00:00:53,442
(Leonard:)- What did I do wrong?
- Why are you asking me?

18
00:00:53,981 --> 00:00:57,191
(Sheldon:)I have no information
about your interactions with Penny...

19
00:00:57,359 --> 00:01:02,019
(Sheldon:)...nor do I have any method
of learning such things.

